,"text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/QR4bF5MTuyRhcZujGQfWAvPastSZ54KS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"うっ、防衛室から連絡が…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/gHEDIfKgen0e8Oqw9ESCjA7xvUm5TSo3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"今日もキヴォトスが平和でありますよう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/FA4zRELattT8CKML2vmQQYkdjJa1Dzro.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"容疑者、確保。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/KnIqtJ6QmQFT2fRH90tDwe4Tv68ecbJr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"さぁ…尋問を始めよう…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/hxbRYBNLLJmXQazjlO8uSJTTFGIoWIyv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"私をだまそうとしても無駄だ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/XxjrLLAwQAJGcPmHnAA9KXeiEb0B4Ayy.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"狂犬の名を、一度は聞いたことがあるだろう？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/CTlEF5SZRIYojOdxuUvmlgVi5W7oGxsm.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"ヴァルキューレ公安局だ。止まれ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/yoc364LcduvY6Wt6tqveipCaw7mkVmQ3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"動くな！ 動いたら犯人とみなす！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/ZlLYsXyyhJrgVTAbTHWMNLlia5BGUBIo.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"間に合ったか…！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/0RCvkThaoZm0pEkrXhWNAQqALN94e4mH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"そういえば、この銃が扱えず苦労をしていた時もありました。銃に慣れてきた今はほとんど使う機会がなくなって残念ですが…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/uJEbEmxdfjs10yTZ5dNi8MdRhuOXi77m.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"公安局の出番ですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/xHck189S8swyPaSplChaXDFET53OMjMl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"ご命令とあれば。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/Yv8pLzGfxOBAyl2MAIPJhaSAPB3dmXkP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"ヴァルキューレ警察学校、公安局局長の尾刃カンナです。 犯罪者の尋問なら、お任せを。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/351MmjTk8AWvjZUASl1bz6fXw9uCqu1e.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"なるほど、そんな方法が。いい勉強になりました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/ZzFauFnHyTrSIcuXQZvRtjKw7SNWw4Gh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"今日の訓練は、これで十分でしょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/BNDcYdEx24NzmiXU9W7XHgy0fWISSrN9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"市民の為に、日々精進します。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/l2sJsPgjmCm8obv6oHBDsnwbRNMtNhMR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"局長といえど、鍛錬を怠っては、部下の模範になれません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/9i0srehQl84fY1Q5AlvQaDuoAYxJsQJ5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"公安局が出動するためには、必要な書類が多くて… シャーレの迅速な対応がうらやましくなる時があります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/rJlbMkBbx1du14fWZr2424h0Pu4BSTHq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"もちろん私には、これらの責任を負う能力も権限もありませんが…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/osPBOJqvJEzL0hkx7Z0N1kO5NlyORbJc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"コーヒーを淹れてこようと思うのですが… 先生も飲みますか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/bxtAdbVdHZ1NKCNIkSlUFZagrTQKiuxl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"生活安全局の子たちはいい警察ではあります… ですが重犯罪を担当するにはまだ早いです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/2sRARsZG3bFbQ6pAv8r2GXLV9FKK4emy.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"ドーナッツは好きではありません。手が汚れますから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/VdCGb7Ly4sFybESIiFer7IUHDRNMSPKC.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"狂犬のあだ名は… その…恥ずかしいですから、あまり人前では呼ばないでください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/WiGDHunEiE5ZyhWNnxAOlHw8Mug7BwoX.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"お待ちしておりました、先生。 公安局の力が必要でしたら、いつでも。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/dTCqnKO4aDuEIAgPTePBs7PljtV2f05B.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"…事件ですか？ 少々お待ちを。令状を発行してきます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/sK2Y7ptei18Gq0EBPZHyWtIbUp1WCPQ5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"先生がこのような屋台にいらっしゃるとは… 予想外でした…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/E7K6sHG89jdq2TMSijtVS3wwPMKi7NR5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"そうですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/hMJPITGIsCQtPk9xkrqPj9jiF6wveSna.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"私はここが、一番落ち着くんです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/Hff3Ch9Z09JCMAPLwDfP74YHghj7xQDH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"皆が恐れる普及の公安局の局長であっても…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/AkpYWce4EILZWV539W9RshBb6khVz3Pk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"…鎧を外せる場所ぐらい、必要ですから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/eKdF3LBddPSzwBVgvU7vXC4qNf16i2ji.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"ですので今日は、","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/vI1wKDYOPiHmAJ71UtRk0iYeVylTM9Ya.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"見なかったことにしていただけると、幸いです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/Tw5Ulk4xZXkuWoRq4osJH9zYWmUA5nbR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"世の大人が皆、先生の様な方であれば、私たちが仕事をすることもないのに…。……はぁ、独り言です。気にしないでください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/JUWOeAzrMM8t50us381rYDlQqmMXXTp9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"いくら私でも、先生を尋問して情報を引き出すのは不可能でしょうね。ふふっ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/DFrY39uXczqCHuh4qh2l7DIiCg9N4JiT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"先生と生徒の恋愛…？ハッ？な、なにを仰って！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/FYRHiE6BGnqr9r1kIgPTlUVBIwTB4HS4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"たまには、シャーレを頼るとします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/TLYZ2qcDl0ts2WunGBF2LdS6BXbUBuLM.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"あ…今日は私の誕生日でしたか。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/krfkYaH1923OjUNmSkCalikm1dGTDTRz.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"朝から局員たちに祝われはしましたが…昨日、無事逮捕できた事を言われているのかと勘違いしておりました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/m1hgsIA7SpAZ1tgYRbCB9GBBwXv36vrx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"今日は誕生日でしたか。おめでとうございます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/0t5qsk20z1d30xqIUzFSvRLm8nzM3UlR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"ヴァルキューレ警察学校に籍を置く身として、 直接贈り物をすることはできませんが…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/FzEnOyYUJV7wBeCnfJQrwm3L1zDU9b3D.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Birthday_Player_3","category":"lobby","text":"もしよろしければ、行きつけのお店でご馳走します。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/LpRBwTelglWyxg3UsmclwSnL5vWfVVWY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"ハロウィーン…。捜査を遅延させる厄介な時期が戻ってきましたね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/emDALluIjrYMulEf36VUbhRbawCWzZKy.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"仮装集団の中に犯罪者が紛れてしまうと、モンタージュ照合が難しくなりますので…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/DogThge2wxhwTjpuaROtsAcwbfrsKxQj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとうございます。 今年は捜査中に顔を合わせることが少ないといいですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/Qy92Hciyw85odiDf66pXsmiDD0vcCFvv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"…もしかして、今日も夜勤を？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/5k4oXc4tgglT3yjqKIPokjuyECCPruqJ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"残念ながら、私も今日は当直です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/23nGr5ILPCyQeW0Wi7JlR6m1VkC3dVoP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0170_Season_Xmas_3","category":"lobby","text":"…せっかくのクリスマスです。 ブラックコーヒーの代わりに、甘いラテはいかがですか？ すぐにお持ちします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/czshmUSROmAKT6mKfQ30pz4MxD34aXBn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"書類になにか不備でも？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/jp/ch0170_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0170_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里的咖啡…… 闻着挺香的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"好累啊……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"居然在这里找到了 兔子侦探系列的新作……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"呃，防卫室 打过来的电话……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"希望基沃托斯 今天也一片和平。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"已逮捕嫌疑人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"哼，开始审讯吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"撒谎是没有用的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"你应该听说过“疯狗”这个名字吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"瓦尔基丽公共安全局，不准动！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"别动！再动就以犯人论处！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"还好赶上了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"说起来， 曾经也因为不习惯这把枪而吃尽了苦头。 可在我熟悉了这把枪后， 却再也没有多少使用它的机会， 真是遗憾哪……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"轮到公共安全局出场了吗。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"如果这是命令的话。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是瓦尔基丽警员学院，公共安全局局长，尾刃康娜。 如果要审讯犯人的话，那就交给我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"原来还有这种方法……嗯，我学到了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"这样的话……今天的的训练就足够了吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"为了市民们，我每天都会认真工作。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"虽然我是局长，但如果我疏于锻炼，也无法成为下属们的榜样。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"公共安全局出动时需要提交很多文件……所以有时我很羡慕沙勒能迅速采取行动。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"当然， 我也没有担起这种责任的权限， 也没有这样的能力……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"我正打算去煮杯咖啡…… 老师也要来一杯吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"生活安全局的孩子们都是好警员……只是让她们去负责重案还是太早了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"吃甜甜圈很容易弄脏手， 所以我不喜欢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"疯狗的外号……呃……我觉得有些尴尬， 所以请尽量不要在别人面前这么叫我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"我正等你呢，老师。如果需要公共安全局的力量，请随时告诉我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"……发生案件了吗？请稍等，我这就去申请搜查令。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"我完全没想到，老师竟然会来这种 路边摊吃饭……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"是吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"我只有待在这里， 才能彻底放松下来。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"即使是让大家闻风丧胆， 从不休息的公共安全局局长……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"……也需要一个能卸下铠甲， 好好休息的地方。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"咳，所以今天……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果老师能当作 没有见过我的话， 那就再好不过了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"如果世界上所有大人都和老师一样，我们就没必要工作了……只是自言自语而已，请不要在意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"就算是我，也不能从老师口中盘问出情报吧，呵呵。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师和学员的感情……？啊！你，你在说什么胡话！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"有时，我也会依赖沙勒。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊……啊， 原来今天是我的生日啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"我就说局里的人 怎么一大早就在祝贺我，我还以为是庆祝 昨天顺利逮捕罪犯的事情。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天是你的生日啊， 祝你生日快乐。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然身为瓦尔基丽的一员，我不能直接送你礼物……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_birthday_player_3","category":"lobby","text":"但方便的话， 我可以在自己常去的店请你吃饭。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_birthday_player_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐。 接下来我要去巡逻， 恕我失陪…… 诶？想和我一起去？ 可以是可以， 但是既枯燥又辛苦…… 你说这都是为了市民和我？ 谢，谢谢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节呀……又到了会影响搜查的时候了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果罪犯混进 变装游行的队伍里，就很难对比模拟画像了……真让人头疼。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师，中秋快乐。 公共安全局收到了一些月饼， 要是感兴趣就尝尝吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝你新年快乐。希望今年 能少在搜查中与你见面。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"……难道今天你也要加班？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"不幸的是，今天我也要值班。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_season_xmas_3","category":"lobby","text":"……难得过圣诞节，把平时的黑咖啡 换成甜的拿铁怎么样？我现在去准备。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_season_xmas_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/ch0170_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"CH0170_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%E5%88%83%20%E5%8F%B6%E6%B8%9A/original/CH0170_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0170_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%BE%